//! # Slots
//!
//! 0. `program` — readonly, pinned `CAMMCzo5YL8w4VFF8KVHrK22GGUsp5VTaW7grrKgrWqK`
//! 1. `payer` — signer
//! 2. `amm_config` — readonly
//! 3. `pool` — writable
//! 4. `input_token_account` — writable
//! 5. `output_token_account` — writable
